01:09:08.000 --> 01:09:13.180
And they usually have the Latin that describes the mission.

01:09:13.200 --> 01:09:19.780
But in a way that's really opaque and even making fun of outsiders, right?

01:09:19.820 --> 01:09:20.720
So this is the mission.

01:09:20.860 --> 01:09:23.760
You could even, you know, go online and see a lot of those patches.

01:09:24.080 --> 01:09:29.120
