01:13:19.500 --> 01:13:30.540
And I think Ryan Bledsoe, who's Chris's son, said that Tyler had told Chris that he was part of a group with Townsend Brown, who I just mentioned.

01:13:30.660 --> 01:13:36.840
So Townsend Brown's this, like, fascinating mid-century inventor who I think, you know, made more discoveries in the world of gravity than meet the eye.

01:13:37.000 --> 01:13:39.800
You know, might have tied gravity and electromagnetism together.

01:13:40.200 --> 01:13:42.380
And that has implications for time as well.

01:13:42.380 --> 01:13:45.920
Because if you can shift gravity at all, you can shift time and general relativity.

01:13:46.600 --> 01:13:49.440
And he would talk in his private life constantly about time travel.

01:13:49.620 --> 01:13:59.980
And so what I found just so fascinating is Tyler tells the Bledsoes that he was involved with a group that was based in Nassau and the Bahamas.

01:14:00.700 --> 01:14:05.220
And Townsend Brown was the president of this group and time travel technology was involved.

