01:16:33.120 --> 01:16:34.920
They felt because they did not know.

01:16:35.320 --> 01:16:38.820
And so Tyler actually asked me if I would help them write the eulogy.

01:16:39.400 --> 01:16:41.200
So I did, I wrote the eulogy.

01:16:41.200 --> 01:16:44.280
And during the time period of writing it was so emotional

01:16:44.280 --> 01:16:48.020
because I was like, wow, you know, how, how do I say this?

01:16:48.020 --> 01:16:50.220
You know, so I helped them, I helped them write it.

01:16:50.640 --> 01:16:54.540
And, uh, they really, they reached out to me afterwards and they were,

01:16:54.600 --> 01:16:58.740
uh, it was consoling to them because they, because someone outside

01:16:58.740 --> 01:17:00.460
the family recognized their pain.

01:17:00.760 --> 01:17:01.980
That's so amazing.

01:17:02.500 --> 01:17:03.040
Wow.

01:17:03.140 --> 01:17:03.640
Yeah.

01:17:04.180 --> 01:17:07.760
Well, do you think that these invisibles are sort of outing themselves right now?

01:17:07.760 --> 01:17:08.780
It seems, it seems like.

01:17:08.780 --> 01:17:12.240
Some, yeah, it seems like they're, they're done with this kind of life.

