01:18:47.620 --> 01:18:52.580
Um, so there's the Dharma, but of course there's the Sangha and you can only do it

01:18:52.580 --> 01:18:55.600
in a group because you have each other to help each other.

01:18:56.140 --> 01:18:56.580
Hmm.

